  "goodToKnow": "Die Sommerpause is the summer break or recess: die parlamentarische Sommerpause, the Bundesliga's Sommerpause. During it, politicians give a traditional Sommerinterview on TV. Slow news days are called das Sommerloch (summer hole), when odd stories, like escaped animals, fill the papers. School summer holidays (Sommerferien) are staggered by state. Plural: die Sommerpausen."
